      <cyrillic>хажуу</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XAZIΓU</transcript>
      <definition>[= xazaγu, xazau] n. and adj. Side, flank, near.</definition>
      <page>948</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠪᠡᠷ = ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣᠪᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ber = xaziγuber</transcript>
          <definition> From the side, on the side.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠺᠡᠪᠲᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ber kebteky</transcript>
          <definition> To lie on the side.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- dur</transcript>
          <definition> Around, near, in the neighborhood of.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠡᠴᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ece</transcript>
          <definition> Sideways, by the side, from the side.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠭᠡᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jin ger</transcript>
