        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠬᠠᠭᠠᠯᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jin xaγalγ-a</transcript>
          <definition> Side gate.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠵᠢᠭᠣ ᠲᠠᠯ᠎ᠠ ᠡᠴᠡ ᠳᠣᠪᠲᠤᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tal-a ece dobtulxu</transcript>
